hamsterdan-cli
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package ports the parts of CPython 3.14's argparse module that the
Hamsterdan command lines use (https://github.com/henriquebastos/hamsterdan,
pinned under upstream/hamsterdan): parsing, abbreviations, subcommands,
usage and help formatting, and the error messages.

